@host = http://localhost:9090/api
@uri = {{host}}/pagos
@token = PEGAR_AQUI_EL_TOKEN_DEL_LOGIN

### Listar todos
GET {{uri}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Obtener por id
GET {{uri}}/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Registro que no existe (404)
GET {{uri}}/9999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Filtrar primera página de 10
GET {{uri}}/filter/0/10?metodo=SINPE&referencia=
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Filtrar segunda página de 5
GET {{uri}}/filter/5/5?metodo=SINPE&referencia=
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Filtrar con límite mayor a 100 (422)
GET {{uri}}/filter/0/500?metodo=SINPE&referencia=
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Filtrar con offset negativo (422)
GET {{uri}}/filter/-1/10?metodo=SINPE&referencia=
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Insertar con JSON inválido (400)
POST {{uri}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}



### Insertar pago válido
POST {{uri}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "reserva_tour_id": 2,
    "registrado_por": 2,
    "monto": 76000,
    "metodo": "SINPE",
    "referencia": "2026122000112233",
    "pagado_at": "2026-12-20 08:45:00"
}

### Insertar con método que no existe (400)
POST {{uri}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "reserva_tour_id": 2,
    "registrado_por": 2,
    "monto": 5000,
    "metodo": "CHEQUE",
    "pagado_at": "2026-12-20 08:45:00"
}

### Insertar con moneda EUR (400)
POST {{uri}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "reserva_tour_id": 2,
    "registrado_por": 2,
    "monto": 50,
    "moneda": "EUR",
    "metodo": "TARJETA",
    "referencia": "AUT-111111",
    "pagado_at": "2026-12-20 08:45:00"
}

### Insertar con referencia con espacios (400)
POST {{uri}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "reserva_tour_id": 2,
    "registrado_por": 2,
    "monto": 5000,
    "metodo": "TARJETA",
    "referencia": "AUT 111111",
    "pagado_at": "2026-12-20 08:45:00"
}

### Insertar con monto 0 (400)
POST {{uri}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "reserva_tour_id": 2,
    "registrado_por": 2,
    "monto": 0,
    "metodo": "EFECTIVO",
    "pagado_at": "2026-12-20 08:45:00"
}

### Insertar sin fecha de pago (400)
POST {{uri}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "reserva_tour_id": 2,
    "registrado_por": 2,
    "monto": 5000,
    "metodo": "EFECTIVO"
}

### Insertar sin ninguna reserva (422 desde datos)
POST {{uri}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "registrado_por": 2,
    "monto": 5000,
    "metodo": "EFECTIVO",
    "pagado_at": "2026-12-20 08:45:00"
}

### ===== Reglas de negocio =====
### Pago asociado a las dos reservas a la vez (400)
POST {{uri}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "reserva_habitacion_id": 1,
    "reserva_tour_id": 1,
    "monto": 1000,
    "metodo": "EFECTIVO"
}

### Pago sin registrado_por: se toma el usuario del token
POST {{uri}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "reserva_habitacion_id": 1,
    "monto": 1000,
    "moneda": "CRC",
    "metodo": "SINPE",
    "referencia": "SINPE-0001"
}

###
